# SASS / BEM

Use BEM: `.block__element--modifier`.

Property order per rule (blank lines between groups):

1. Positioning (`position`, `top`, `z-index`, …)
2. Box model size (`width`, `height`, …)
3. Spacing (`padding`, `margin`, …)
4. Display & layout (`display`, `flex`, `gap`, …)
5. Background & borders
6. Typography
7. Other (`cursor`, `opacity`, `transition`, …)
